  <description>
    <p>
      Sibir is a Soviet-era survival horror extraction game: receive a State mandate,
      descend into a procedural bunker, complete objectives, and extract before the anomaly finds you.
    </p>
    <p>Steam multiplayer is optional and requires the Steam client when using Steam networking.</p>
  </description>
